  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LittleBigHelp COVID-19 Emergency Pool project Empowering Individuals in India to create a brighter future 2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through computer training for tribal youth, the project empowers young people living in rural villages with basic computer skills.

In the girls&#x2019; and boys&#x2019; homes (orphanages supported by the project), vulnerable girls and boys can get away from the streets and start a new life with care, comfort, nutrition and education &#x2013; and a place to call &#x2018;home&#x2019;.

At nine community centres, the project prepares children for school, support their families and raise awareness about the rights for people living in slum areas.

The project support the centre for special education, which offers care and education for children and adolescents with special needs.</narrative>
  </description>
